WEBVTT

00:08:58.744 --> 00:09:02.997
and they'd responded with letters,
comments and emails.

00:09:04.046 --> 00:09:08.754
It was a mix, as is often
the case, for writers.

00:09:09.773 --> 00:09:12.408
I got a lot of unsolicited advice

00:09:12.432 --> 00:09:16.075
about how to cure my cancer
with things like essential oils.

00:09:17.281 --> 00:09:20.304
I got some questions about my bra size.

00:09:20.687 --> 00:09:22.527
But mostly --

00:09:22.551 --> 00:09:23.654
(Laughter)

00:09:23.678 --> 00:09:28.416
mostly, I heard from people who,
in their own different way,

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:30.922
understood what it was
that I was going through.